(6307886, 933958, 124346, '<td valign="top">Maybe you couldn''t do, but a lower position of you and a higher angle of the camera may resulted in a better shot, that way you could''ve shown the zig zag pipes.  Try that.</td>', 'Maybe you couldn''t do, but a lower position of you and a higher angle of the camera may resulted in a better shot, that way you could''ve shown the zig zag pipes.  Try that.', '2011-02-09 08:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6307897, 934566, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sigh... I shot that identical picture back in 1974 or so :-) With the big view camera. It''s unfortunate that you misspelled Louis Kahn''s name :-( I sent a request to SC to see if they can change it, you might try the same.<br/> <br/>Fabulous leading lines shot, wonderful image of this iconic architecture. Feel free to PM me if you wish re: the name.</td>', 'Sigh... I shot that identical picture back in 1974 or so :-) With the big view camera. It''s unfortunate that you misspelled Louis Kahn''s name :-( I sent a request to SC to see if they can change it, you might try the same. Fabulous leading lines shot, wonderful image of this iconic architecture. Feel free to PM me if you wish re: the name.', '2011-02-09 09:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6307899, 934530, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice work to clean up the whites! Well done! Not voting, let me know how you''re doing if you like via PM.</td>', 'Nice work to clean up the whites! Well done! Not voting, let me know how you''re doing if you like via PM.', '2011-02-09 09:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
