(6309683, 933736, 93565, '<td valign="top">While this looks like a jumbled mess of crenulations on the surface of the concrete, it is actually pretty cool visually. What''s interesting is the various horizontal levels, which lower my as on a ladder, down the image, but those two diagonal dark lines bring me back up. Interesting effect, like the photo is forcing me to engage in elevator eyes.</td>', 'While this looks like a jumbled mess of crenulations on the surface of the concrete, it is actually pretty cool visually. What''s interesting is the various horizontal levels, which lower my as on a ladder, down the image, but those two diagonal dark lines bring me back up. Interesting effect, like the photo is forcing me to engage in elevator eyes.', '2011-02-11 03:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6309684, 934485, 93565, '<td valign="top">Somewhat strange, but I like it. The lights feel particularly serpentine, especially how they fade towards the end, like the tail thins or is under the surface of the "water" (whatever it actually is).</td>', 'Somewhat strange, but I like it. The lights feel particularly serpentine, especially how they fade towards the end, like the tail thins or is under the surface of the "water" (whatever it actually is).', '2011-02-11 04:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6309688, 934412, 93565, '<td valign="top">This would benefit a loot from us being able to see the fence continue. It gets lost in shadow. In a similar vein, the dog''s head is the same color as the background beyond, making them bleed together. I would also consider boosting the brightness of your midtones a bit, since it seems a bit dark (but obviously you couldn''t have exposed much higher since the clouds are bright).</td>', 'This would benefit a loot from us being able to see the fence continue. It gets lost in shadow. In a similar vein, the dog''s head is the same color as the background beyond, making them bleed together. I would also consider boosting the brightness of your midtones a bit, since it seems a bit dark (but obviously you couldn''t have exposed much higher since the clouds are bright).', '2011-02-11 04:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6309691, 934069, 93565, '<td valign="top">Oh I love this. Reminds me of a shot I took in October-<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=917528" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/93565/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_917528.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/93565/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_917528.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/93565/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_917528.jpg"/></a> <br/>Very nice.</td>', 'Oh I love this. Reminds me of a shot I took in October- Very nice.', '2011-02-11 04:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
