(6309740, 934537, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very creative use of the Leading Lines for the challenge. Probably DNMC for the literalists, but I love it! Interesting choice of low contrast/high grain PP..not sure if it''ll work for the masses though. <br/> <br/>Great photo, I really like it - 7 (PS...hope you had lots of baggies with you for this bunch of pooches! Looks like a handful!)</td>', 'Very creative use of the Leading Lines for the challenge. Probably DNMC for the literalists, but I love it! Interesting choice of low contrast/high grain PP..not sure if it''ll work for the masses though.  Great photo, I really like it - 7 (PS...hope you had lots of baggies with you for this bunch of pooches! Looks like a handful!)', '2011-02-11 08:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
