(6310672, 934395, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is probably the best of the literalist Leading Lines photographs.  You''ve managed to navigate elegantly between satisfying the DNMC Police''s lamentable and myopic literalism, and the aesthete''s more liberated expectations.  A very fine photograph in every sense.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is probably the best of the literalist Leading Lines photographs.  You''ve managed to navigate elegantly between satisfying the DNMC Police''s lamentable and myopic literalism, and the aesthete''s more liberated expectations.  A very fine photograph in every sense.  Thank you.', '2011-02-12 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6310678, 933736, 30364, '<td valign="top">Demanding and enlightened.  Driving the point home with a feather, rather than with a hammer.  I love it.  Thank you.</td>', 'Demanding and enlightened.  Driving the point home with a feather, rather than with a hammer.  I love it.  Thank you.', '2011-02-12 11:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6310680, 934577, 30364, '<td valign="top">PLeasingly lovely, and the emphatic convergence onto the relatively small area of uncertainty is a masterstroke of understatement.   Thank you.</td>', 'PLeasingly lovely, and the emphatic convergence onto the relatively small area of uncertainty is a masterstroke of understatement.   Thank you.', '2011-02-12 11:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6310683, 934414, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The photograph is interesting and the title is confoundingly ... er, confounding.  Can''t ask for much more than that!  Thank you.</td>', 'I like this.  The photograph is interesting and the title is confoundingly ... er, confounding.  Can''t ask for much more than that!  Thank you.', '2011-02-12 11:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6310684, 934190, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovingly made image.  Simple and sweet.  Thank you.</td>', 'Lovingly made image.  Simple and sweet.  Thank you.', '2011-02-12 11:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6310687, 934381, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  If this doesn''t give the viewer pause, what would?  A hundred ways to experience it, and only one (total absence of curiosity) to pass it by.  Superb photograph.  Thank you.</td>', 'Beautiful.  If this doesn''t give the viewer pause, what would?  A hundred ways to experience it, and only one (total absence of curiosity) to pass it by.  Superb photograph.  Thank you.', '2011-02-12 11:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6310692, 934537, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wickedly witty and elegantly executed; both so lamentably undersupplied in this challenge.  Thanks for the top-up.  Elliott Erwitt would be barking with delight.  Me too.  Woof!</td>', 'Wickedly witty and elegantly executed; both so lamentably undersupplied in this challenge.  Thanks for the top-up.  Elliott Erwitt would be barking with delight.  Me too.  Woof!', '2011-02-12 11:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6310699, 933389, 30364, '<td valign="top">Now and then a delightfully low-fidelity photograph can achieve so much more than a ponderously literal one.  This is one of those glorious cases.  The joy in it would be diminished by anything ''less'' than the sparse presentation you have conjured up here.  It''s not in itself great photography of course, and yet it really is a great photograph in another sense entirely.  It <i>reaches</i>.  A bloody beauty.  Top two for me.  Thank you.</td>', 'Now and then a delightfully low-fidelity photograph can achieve so much more than a ponderously literal one.  This is one of those glorious cases.  The joy in it would be diminished by anything ''less'' than the sparse presentation you have conjured up here.  It''s not in itself great photography of course, and yet it really is a great photograph in another sense entirely.  It reaches.  A bloody beauty.  Top two for me.  Thank you.', '2011-02-12 11:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6310703, 934182, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is so good that it hardly needs approbation.  So I''ll just shut up and say 10.  My top pick in the challenge.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is so good that it hardly needs approbation.  So I''ll just shut up and say 10.  My top pick in the challenge.  Thank you.', '2011-02-12 12:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
