(6313171, 934302, 69034, '<td valign="top">I hate to vote on shots in places where I used to live.  However, I love the combination of the pier and the bridge, really well composed.</td>', 'I hate to vote on shots in places where I used to live.  However, I love the combination of the pier and the bridge, really well composed.', '2011-02-14 13:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313430, 933389, 16241, '<td valign="top">me too</td>', 'me too', '2011-02-14 15:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313434, 934517, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think you may have missed the concept of leading lines. This technique is the use of lines in your photograph to lead the viewer into or through the photo. The lines here don''t lead us anywhere</td>', 'I think you may have missed the concept of leading lines. This technique is the use of lines in your photograph to lead the viewer into or through the photo. The lines here don''t lead us anywhere', '2011-02-14 15:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313440, 934287, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but it feels like the contrast is a bit off. There is a lot of middle gray without much on the black/white ends (with the exception of the person, the black/whites on him/her are so dramatic, it makes them look like a ghost!)</td>', 'Nice scene, but it feels like the contrast is a bit off. There is a lot of middle gray without much on the black/white ends (with the exception of the person, the black/whites on him/her are so dramatic, it makes them look like a ghost!)', '2011-02-14 15:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313442, 934138, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and reflections in this photo. A perfect chance for some HDR techniques (of course, not in basic editing) to bring out more details in those shadows.</td>', 'Great perspective and reflections in this photo. A perfect chance for some HDR techniques (of course, not in basic editing) to bring out more details in those shadows.', '2011-02-14 15:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313443, 934300, 105938, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2011-02-14 15:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313448, 934588, 114225, '<td valign="top">IS it just me, or is the bridge warped? Looks like it''s falling into the sea.<br/>Nothing you can do about that in a Basic Editing challenge, but it might be worth trying this shot again and moving the camera to look a little further left (to avoid the lens barrel distortion).</td>', 'IS it just me, or is the bridge warped? Looks like it''s falling into the sea.Nothing you can do about that in a Basic Editing challenge, but it might be worth trying this shot again and moving the camera to look a little further left (to avoid the lens barrel distortion).', '2011-02-14 15:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313478, 933814, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the for and grays. I wonder what this would have looked like if you would have cropped it a bit tighter, so that we would get more of a feeling of infinite repeating structures. If that doesn''t make sense and you want more information, please PM me.</td>', 'Nice use of the for and grays. I wonder what this would have looked like if you would have cropped it a bit tighter, so that we would get more of a feeling of infinite repeating structures. If that doesn''t make sense and you want more information, please PM me.', '2011-02-14 16:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313487, 934430, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like where you were headed with this, but I think it could have had a lot more impact with some symmetry. If you would have moved a few more steps to the right, I think this would have been more powerful.</td>', 'I like where you were headed with this, but I think it could have had a lot more impact with some symmetry. If you would have moved a few more steps to the right, I think this would have been more powerful.', '2011-02-14 16:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313492, 933824, 114225, '<td valign="top">My eyes! :)<br/>This feels like it''s either just a tiny bit off center, or a tiny bit rotated (or both), which is causing the photo to lose some of the magic.</td>', 'My eyes! :)This feels like it''s either just a tiny bit off center, or a tiny bit rotated (or both), which is causing the photo to lose some of the magic.', '2011-02-14 16:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313501, 934191, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great creativity for this challenge. I would have never thought of photographing a flower for leading lines.</td>', 'Great creativity for this challenge. I would have never thought of photographing a flower for leading lines.', '2011-02-14 16:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313502, 934355, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job balancing the exposure. There is a nice amount of detail in the shadows.</td>', 'Great job balancing the exposure. There is a nice amount of detail in the shadows.', '2011-02-14 16:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313503, 933832, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s really cool how you used the curvature of this lens to your advantage.</td>', 'Wow, that''s really cool how you used the curvature of this lens to your advantage.', '2011-02-14 16:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313504, 934421, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic sky, great detail in the foreground snow, and the combined sense of serenity and energy in this scene.</td>', 'I like the dramatic sky, great detail in the foreground snow, and the combined sense of serenity and energy in this scene.', '2011-02-14 16:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313505, 934566, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really hope you put in the notes an explanation of what''s going on. Is it some type of filtering plant, or just an artistic "fountain".</td>', 'I really hope you put in the notes an explanation of what''s going on. Is it some type of filtering plant, or just an artistic "fountain".', '2011-02-14 16:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313506, 934069, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting. My eyes are traveling down the road, take a detour to admire the tree, and then hop back on the road the keep traveling down.</td>', 'Interesting. My eyes are traveling down the road, take a detour to admire the tree, and then hop back on the road the keep traveling down.', '2011-02-14 16:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313508, 934116, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice scene. It''s too bad they put up electrical lines, this would have looked so much cooler without them.</td>', 'Nice scene. It''s too bad they put up electrical lines, this would have looked so much cooler without them.', '2011-02-14 16:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313509, 934534, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely. It''s so nice when you get to either be the first one down a freshly snowed road, or observe the tracks of the first brave soul.</td>', 'Lovely. It''s so nice when you get to either be the first one down a freshly snowed road, or observe the tracks of the first brave soul.', '2011-02-14 16:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313530, 934182, 16241, '<td valign="top">life, lively photo.</td>', 'life, lively photo.', '2011-02-14 16:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313626, 933824, 91342, '<td valign="top">Had trouble finding the bird; but love this type of image.  Symmetrical is good.</td>', 'Had trouble finding the bird; but love this type of image.  Symmetrical is good.', '2011-02-14 18:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313627, 933736, 91342, '<td valign="top">Clever idea; texture is great, wish the black spot was a bit bigger.</td>', 'Clever idea; texture is great, wish the black spot was a bit bigger.', '2011-02-14 18:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313628, 933430, 91342, '<td valign="top">Surroundings are distracting</td>', 'Surroundings are distracting', '2011-02-14 18:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313630, 934570, 91342, '<td valign="top">move a bit to your left to get tower legs from between the horns.</td>', 'move a bit to your left to get tower legs from between the horns.', '2011-02-14 18:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313631, 933939, 91342, '<td valign="top">nicely framed</td>', 'nicely framed', '2011-02-14 18:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6313635, 934499, 91342, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  Looks like she is tending to walk out the left away from the lines leading to the center.  Just a bit unsettling.  Perhaps unsettling is good.</td>', 'nice idea.  Looks like she is tending to walk out the left away from the lines leading to the center.  Just a bit unsettling.  Perhaps unsettling is good.', '2011-02-14 18:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
