(6316466, 934566, 124815, '<td valign="top">Kahn himself counted on this photo being taken over and over again. This was his dream for his design. There are numerous pictures shot exactly from the same vintage point etc. - there is the beautiful 2003 movie also "My Architect". And your photo stands proud among all of the other ones. You captured beautifully this impeccable calmness. Some photos had the sun at the exact vanishing point. I like very much your off centered person and the guiled timelessness of your photo. Thanks.</td>', 'Kahn himself counted on this photo being taken over and over again. This was his dream for his design. There are numerous pictures shot exactly from the same vintage point etc. - there is the beautiful 2003 movie also "My Architect". And your photo stands proud among all of the other ones. You captured beautifully this impeccable calmness. Some photos had the sun at the exact vanishing point. I like very much your off centered person and the guiled timelessness of your photo. Thanks.', '2011-02-16 07:48:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6316467, 934566, 35720, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue ribbon Lev, well deserved!</td>', 'Congrats on the blue ribbon Lev, well deserved!', '2011-02-16 07:56:50.000000', NULL, 0),
