(6317399, 934566, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bspurgeon:</b></div><hr/><i> Well done Lev! Wasn''t this an oh by the way? "I think I''ll stop of at the Salk for tonight''s challenge." Ha! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>almost like this, Ben. Was not planning to enter this challenge, but on Monday went to a seminar at Salk, and there in the courtyard it struck me that this view would be perfect for Leading lines. So I came back on Tuesday evening (yes, on the way from work :)) to take this photo. Barely made it, because they close the institute for visitors at 6pm</td>', 'Originally posted by bspurgeon: Well done Lev! Wasn''t this an oh by the way? "I think I''ll stop of at the Salk for tonight''s challenge." Ha!  almost like this, Ben. Was not planning to enter this challenge, but on Monday went to a seminar at Salk, and there in the courtyard it struck me that this view would be perfect for Leading lines. So I came back on Tuesday evening (yes, on the way from work :)) to take this photo. Barely made it, because they close the institute for visitors at 6pm', '2011-02-16 17:26:25.000000', NULL, 0),
