(6477662, 934540, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful leading lines- vastly underrated. Perhaps the greens and blues are to strong and vibrant in hue, not tonal and grayed offf enough; but I really like it. It might be different and perhaps improved with a 1/4 across the board desat.</td>', 'Beautiful leading lines- vastly underrated. Perhaps the greens and blues are to strong and vibrant in hue, not tonal and grayed offf enough; but I really like it. It might be different and perhaps improved with a 1/4 across the board desat.', '2011-07-21 11:34:48.000000', NULL, 0),
